WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.375
Step 3 runs the incident check.

2
00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:03.637
Seven incidents.

3
00:00:03.637 --> 00:00:08.021
Incident 1002, high severity,
has waited three and a half

4
00:00:08.021 --> 00:00:12.213
hours with no owner, against
a one-hour window: overdue.

5
00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:17.313
Incident 1005 was resolved with
its classification still unknown.

6
00:00:17.313 --> 00:00:23.950
And incident 1003, medium, has no owner
yet, but it's inside its twenty-four hours.

7
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.201
Step 4 reads the findings as the
security operations lead gets them,

8
00:00:28.201 --> 00:00:30.175
each with its containment rung.

9
00:00:30.175 --> 00:00:32.054
The high one is the gated rung:

10
00:00:32.054 --> 00:00:35.570
the playbook prepares, and
a named approver releases.
